  "tag": "v1.128.0",
  "body": "## Changelog   \n### ✨ Features   \n* **feat(deploy-token):** Add the delete command ([171edc5a](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/commit/171edc5a)) by Paweł Farys<!--community-->   \n* **feat(df):** fetch Go modules through the user's own GOPROXY ([a8b66b25](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/commit/a8b66b25)) by Arpit Gogia<!--community-->   \n* **feat(df):** support registries behind an upstream proxy ([199f034a](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/commit/199f034a)) by Ryan Wells<!--team-->   \n* **feat(govern):** redact common secret formats before uploading sessions ([e79373a1](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/commit/e79373a1)) by Jean van der Walt<!--team-->   \n### 🐛 Bug Fixes   \n* **fix(api):** offer only HTTP/1.1 to HTTPS proxies ([2ca9e118](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/commit/2ca9e118)) by Arpit Gogia<!--community-->   \n* **fix(config):** keep glab-managed keys in the global config ([289f000f](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/commit/289f000f)) by Jeston Singh<!--community-->   \n* **fix(df):** warn once per registry when a registry request fails ([02d9f1ce](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/commit/02d9f1ce)) by Arpit Gogia<!--community-->   \n* **fix(git):** keep the first HostName for an SSH host alias ([5ce7dc9b](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/commit/5ce7dc9b)) by José M. Requena Plens<!--community-->   \n* **fix(govern):** don't skip a Claude Code transcript entry still being written ([055141e1](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/commit/055141e1)) by Jean van der Walt<!--team-->   \n* **fix(markdown):** preserve hard line breaks ([dc2ea409](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/commit/dc2ea409)) by Zaygal<!--community-->   \n* **fix(project):** show the real total in the contributors list header ([a7bb4af9](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/commit/a7bb4af9)) by Jay McCure<!--team-->   \n* **fix(release):** preserve description and name when omitted on update ([6a3bcf71](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/commit/6a3bcf71)) by Abdelrahman Megahed<!--community-->   \n* **fix(user):** show the real total in the user events header ([0de5b6f8](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/commit/0de5b6f8)) by unstable-code<!--community-->   \n### 📝 Documentation   \n* **docs(skills):** use --description-file and stdin instead of nested heredocs ([ca3e4aea](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/commit/ca3e4aea)) by Andrei Zubov<!--team-->   \n### 🔧 Maintenance   \n* **refactor(packages):** deprecate the rm alias of delete in favour of del ([9f7f7a3e](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/commit/9f7f7a3e)) by Tomas Vik<!--team-->   \n### 📦 Dependencies   \n* **chore(deps):** update module gitlab.com/gitlab-org/api/client-go/v3 to v3.42.0 ([2350dad6](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/commit/2350dad6)) by GitLab Dependency Bot<!--team-->\n\n",
